                <pb facs="0315" n="227" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg227"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Snyder to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1903-12-26"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">December 26,
                    1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Snyder reports that the Chapinero line, Bogotá City Railway Company, an
                    American corporation of New York City, was forcibly seized by the authorities of
                    the Department of Cundinamarca on Christmas. Papers will be sent by next mail.
                    Awaiting instructions.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
